# Public satellite raster for the session-only Standard / Satellite map choice.
# Leave these unset to keep the standard OpenStreetMap background only.
# Do not put credentials, API keys, or private server secrets in NEXT_PUBLIC_* values.
# Do not copy these values into project JSON, source data, edits, calculations, or reports.
#
# First authorized satellite backend (replaceable): free non-commercial EOX public WMTS.
# Verified 2026-09-07 from https://tiles.maps.eox.at/wmts/1.0.0/WMTSCapabilities.xml
# and live HTTPS JPEG tiles: layer s2cloudless-2025_3857, TileMatrixSet g,
# 256 px tiles, native zoom 0-18 (z19 returned 404). WMTS ResourceURL uses
# {TileMatrixSet}/{TileMatrix}/{TileRow}/{TileCol}; MapLibre XYZ maps that to g/{z}/{y}/{x}.
# Attribution text is the WMTS Abstract plus the EOX::Maps link-back requested at https://maps.eox.at/.
# Terms: free public as-is service with required attribution; non-commercial CC BY-NC-SA for this mosaic.
# Do not purchase a mosaic or accept a commercial license for this configuration.

NEXT_PUBLIC_SATELLITE_TILES=https://tiles.maps.eox.at/wmts/1.0.0/s2cloudless-2025_3857/default/g/{z}/{y}/{x}.jpg
NEXT_PUBLIC_SATELLITE_TILE_SIZE=256
NEXT_PUBLIC_SATELLITE_MIN_ZOOM=0
NEXT_PUBLIC_SATELLITE_MAX_ZOOM=18
NEXT_PUBLIC_SATELLITE_ATTRIBUTION=EOxCloudless - https://cloudless.eox.at by EOX IT Services GmbH (Contains modified Copernicus Sentinel data 2025). Maps: https://maps.eox.at
